MundoCraft - Luanti PS4: component licensing
===========================================

This distribution contains components under different licenses. It is not
licensed as a whole under the MIT license, and this document does not relicense
third-party work. Each original copyright notice and license remains in force.

Luanti engine and modifications: LGPL-2.1-or-later. Bundled mini-GMP: the
LGPL-3.0-or-later option is used. Original independently authored support code
covered by LICENSE-MIT.txt retains that MIT grant. Adapted LÖVE PS4 support
retains the terms and attribution in LICENSES/LOVE-PS4.txt.

OpenOrbis replacement PRX modules and their CRT source: GPL-3.0-only. The
OpenOrbis-derived linker script is GPL-3.0-only. Their inclusion does not purport
to relicense every other component. Graphics, image, font, TLS and other
libraries retain the component terms in THIRD_PARTY_NOTICES.md and LICENSES/.
Assets and fonts have their own licenses; the launcher icon has documented
AI-generated provenance. See CREDITS.md and docs/UPSTREAM_POLICY.md.

Complete corresponding modified sources and the build/relink recipes accompany
the release. Source recipients retain the rights granted by each license,
including modification and redistribution. Private repository access does not
add a confidentiality or non-redistribution condition to these grants.

All components are provided without warranty except as their respective
licenses expressly provide. This inventory records provenance and conditions;
it is not a guarantee about all legal questions in every jurisdiction.
